        "customDisplayName": "Calculate Spearman correlation coefficient between PLK1 and CHEK2-S163 abundance in tumor samples. Uses scipy.stats.spearmanr on the clean dataset (n=51 samples with no missing values). Returns correlation rounded to 4 decimal places with p-value and sample count.",
